---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Node as ContextHelp Node
    participant Registry as External Registry
    participant LocalDB as Local Storage

    Note over Node,LocalDB: Delta Registry Sync Flow

    Node->>LocalDB: SELECT last_sync_version<br/>FROM registry_metadata<br/>WHERE name='uxpatterns'
    LocalDB-->>Node: version='2025-01-12'

    Node->>Registry: GET /sync/changes?since=2025-01-12
    activate Registry
    Note right of Registry: Returns delta:<br/>{<br/>  "version": "2025-01-14",<br/>  "added": [...],<br/>  "updated": [...],<br/>  "removed": [...]<br/>}
    Registry-->>Node: 200 OK (delta changes)
    deactivate Registry

    Node->>LocalDB: BEGIN TRANSACTION

    loop For each added item
        Node->>LocalDB: INSERT INTO synced_bookmarks
    end

    loop For each updated item
        Node->>LocalDB: UPDATE synced_bookmarks<br/>WHERE id=...
    end

    loop For each removed item
        Node->>LocalDB: DELETE FROM synced_bookmarks<br/>WHERE id=...
    end

    Node->>LocalDB: UPDATE registry_metadata<br/>SET last_sync_version='2025-01-14'

    Node->>LocalDB: COMMIT TRANSACTION

    Note over Node: Incremental sync complete.<br/>Lower bandwidth, faster updates.
